<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>no more regrets</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">almost monday</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">no more regrets</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">7lgx7t5ZLkdOjiOAjSx9d6</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:08.868" end="00:11.281">Take a picture</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:11.281" end="00:15.483">I wanna put you in a frame and keep ya</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.483" end="00:19.982">That image burnt into my brain, I see ya</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.982" end="00:22.715">And if I don't, I'll go insane</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.715" end="00:25.247">And maybe you're to blame</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.247" end="00:26.747" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.576" end="00:30.869">So get out of my head, and, baby, slide a little closer</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.869" end="00:35.022">Gotta confess, I need some physical exposure</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.022" end="00:41.054">No more regrets, yeah, I'm just tryna get to know ya</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.054" end="00:44.048">So let the music take us over</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.048" end="00:45.548" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.227" end="00:46.346">Can't resist ya</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.346" end="00:50.692">I think I really wanna dance, you'll teach me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.692" end="00:55.146">And if you're open to romance, I'll sweep ya</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.146" end="00:57.935">Just like a masterpiece in France</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.935" end="01:00.526">You put me in a trance</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.526" end="01:02.026" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.959" end="01:05.820">So get out of my head, and, baby, slide a little closer</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.820" end="01:10.276">Gotta confess, I need some physical exposure</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.276" end="01:16.311">No more regrets, yeah, I'm just tryna to get to know ya</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.311" end="01:19.304">So let the music take us over</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.304" end="01:23.557">Get out of my head, and, baby, slide a little closer</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.557" end="01:28.005">Gotta confess, I think I lost all my composure</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.005" end="01:33.979">No more regrets, yeah, I'm just tryna get to know ya</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.979" end="01:38.568">So let the music take us over</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.568" end="01:46.568" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.115" end="01:54.659">Let the music take us over</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.659" end="01:56.159" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.863" end="01:56.864">Well, I know</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.864" end="02:00.562">If somebody's gonna take you out tonight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.562" end="02:03.456" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Let it take you over, sonic rollercoaster)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.456" end="02:05.084">And I know</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:05.084" end="02:08.383">This all might be a dream, nothing's as it really seems</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:08.383" end="02:12.080" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Let it take you over, sonic rollercoaster)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:12.080" end="02:13.580" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:12.256" end="02:16.801">So get out of my head, and, baby, slide a little closer</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:16.801" end="02:21.443">Gotta get this, I need some physical exposure</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:21.443" end="02:27.265">No more regrets, yeah, I'm just tryna get to know ya</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:27.265" end="02:30.489">So let the music take us over</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:30.489" end="02:36.497" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:36.497" end="02:39.122">Let the music take us over</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:39.122" end="02:45.510">No more regrets</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:45.510" end="02:49.510">Let the music take us over</p></div></body></tt>